The production integration adds a fail-closed ROS 2 velocity gateway for the
external LimX signaling service. The signaling server, robot firmware,
credentials/authorization, and a valid hardware identity are not included. The
gateway is not a standalone chassis implementation and must be configured for an
authorized compatible robot before use.

The v1.1.0 integration also adds an explicit local obstacle-cloud subscription
switch for supervised maintenance and stair testing. The normal default stays
enabled. Disabling it is guarded by paused startup, bounded speed, and a
separate operator confirmation in the LimX integration scripts.

